 "ごとき": "حَبَّ (to enjoy) / أَحَبَّ (to enjoy) / اِسْتَمْطَعَ (to enjoy) / أَعْجَبَ (to enjoy) / مِثْل (Similar.) / مِثْل, شِبْه (Someone similar to a given person, or something similar to a given object; a com) / مِثْل, كَـ (Similar to, reminiscent of.) / مِثْل, كَـ (Such as; including.)  [like]\nattributive form of ごとし\nمثال: 立て板に水の如きプレゼンテーション、おそれ入りました。\n→ Your presentation was so smooth and fluent - what can I say? / [something like ... ; someone like ...]\nas ...のごときは",
 "ごとく": "حَبَّ (to enjoy) / أَحَبَّ (to enjoy) / اِسْتَمْطَعَ (to enjoy) / أَعْجَبَ (to enjoy) / مِثْل (Similar.) / مِثْل, شِبْه (Someone similar to a given person, or something similar to a given object; a com) / مِثْل, كَـ (Similar to, reminiscent of.) / مِثْل, كَـ (Such as; including.)  [like]\ncontinuative form of ごとし\nمثال: 彼は脱兎のごとく逃げた。\n→ He ran like a scared rabbit.",
