 "さいげん": "رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [return]\nمثال: 僕は実験方法を学んでいたのではなかったし、実験を再現する方法を学んでいるのでさえなかった。\n→ I was not being taught to experiment or even to repeat experiments. / تَكَاثُر (The act of reproducing new individuals biologically.)  [reproduction]",
