 "さきだつ": "رَصَاص (A heavy, pliable, inelastic metal element, having a bright, bluish color, but ea) / قَادَ (To guide or conduct.) / أَرْشَدَ, هَدَى (To guide or conduct.)  [to lead]\nمثال: このミーティングの目的は、１月の商品企画会議に先立ち、新製品のプランを考えることです。\n→ The purpose of the meeting is to make a plan for a new product prior to the Product Development Meeting in January. / سَبَقَ, سَلَفَ (To go before, go in front of.)  [to precede]\nمثال: おごりは破滅に先立つ。\n→ Pride comes before a fall. / [to die before (esp. one's spouse, parents, etc.)]\nمثال: スミスさんは奥さんに先立たれた。\n→ Mr Smith was bereaved of his wife. / [to be a prerequisite]",
