 "さしつける": "نُقْطَة (A small dot or mark.) / نُقْطَة (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / مَوْقِع (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / أَشَارَ (To extend the index finger in the direction of something in order to show where )  [to point (gun at)]",
 "さしつらぬく": "ثَقَبَ (To puncture; to break through.) / ثَقَبَ (To create a hole in the skin for the purpose of inserting jewelry.)  [to pierce]",
 "さしづめ": "فِي النِّهَايَة (Anyway, in any case; indicates a statement is true regardless of other considera)  [after all]\nمثال: みなプロジェクトを抱えているので、差し詰め、君しか適任者はいない。\n→ Everybody has their own projects on, so after all you are the only suitable candidate. / [for the time being ; at present]\nمثال: 会社をクビになったけど、貯金がすこしあるので、差し詰め生活には困らない。\n→ I got the sack but I've a little saved up, so for the time being I won't be troubled by living expenses.",
 "さして": "حَرُكَ, تَحَرَّكَ (To change place or posture; to go, in any manner, from one place or position to ) / اِنْتَقَلَ, تَحَلْحَلَ (To change residence, for example from one house, town, or state, to another; to )  [move] / [(skilled) shogi player]",
 "さしで": "وَجْهًا لِوَجْه (In person; directly; in the physical presence of somebody.)  [face to face]",
 "さしでがましい": "صَاعِدًا (Into the future.) / مُهَاجِم (One of the eight players (comprising two props, one hooker, two locks, two flank)  [forward]\nمثال: 差し出がましいようですが、私から意見を述べさせて頂きます。\n→ At the risk of sounding too forward, I'd like to make a comment.",
 "さしでる": "حَشَرَ أَنْفَهُ (To interfere or try to intervene in (an issue that does not concern one).)  [to stick one's nose into] / نَتَأَ ((intransitive) to extend above, beyond, or from a boundary o) / بَرَزَ ((intransitive) to extend above, beyond, or from a boundary o)  [to protrude]",
 "さしとおす": "طَعْن (An act of stabbing or thrusting with an object to hurt or kill someone.) / طَعْنَة (A wound made by stabbing.) / طَعَنَ (To pierce or to wound (somebody) with a (usually pointed) tool or weapon, especi)  [to stab]",
 "さしとめ": "حَظْر, مَنْع (An act of prohibiting, forbidding, disallowing, or proscribing something.) / حَظْر (A period of time when specific socially disapproved consumables are considered c)  [prohibition]\nمثال: そのニュースは当分の間差し止めになった。\n→ The news was suppressed for the time being.",
 "さしとめる": "وَقَفَ, تَوَقَّفَ (To cease moving.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to cease moving or progressing.) / تَوَقَّفَ, وَقَّف (To cease; to no longer continue.) / أَوْقَفَ, وَقَفَ (To cause (something) to come to an end.) / مَوْقِف (A (usually marked) place where buses, trams or trains halt to let passengers get) / وَقْفَة (An action of stopping; interruption of travel.)  [to stop]",
 "さしのぞく": "بَدَا (To appear, to seem.) / نَظْرَة, نَظْرَة (The action of looking; an attempt to see.) / مَرْأىً, مَرْآة (Physical appearance, visual impression.)  [to look (into)] / [to stop by ; to drop in]",
 "さしのべる": "تَمَدَّدَ (To lengthen by pulling.) / مَدَّدَ, اِمْتَدَّ (To extend one’s limbs or another part of the body, for example in order to impro)  [to stretch] / [to thrust (javelin)] / اِقْتِرَاح (A proposal that has been made.) / اِقْتَرَحَ, قَدَّمَ (To propose or express one's willingness (to do something).) / قَدَّمَ (To present (something) to God or gods, as a gesture of worship or as a sacrifice)  [to offer (e.g. aid, help, etc.)]\nمثال: 私が出来る限りの援助を彼に差しのべるつもりです。\n→ I'll offer him what help I can.",
 "さしのぼる": "نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise (e.g. sun, moon)]",
 "さしはさむ": "أَدْخَلَ (To put in between or into.)  [to insert] / قَاطَعَ (To disturb or halt (an ongoing process or action, or the person performing it) b)  [to interrupt]\nمثال: 「ええ、そうね」とスーザンが言葉をさしはさむ。「私が電話したのは・・・」\n→ \"Ah, that's true,\" Susan puts in, \"I just wanted to call to ...\" / مَرْفَأ, مَرْسَى (A sheltered expanse of water, adjacent to land, in which ships may anchor or doc)  [to harbor (e.g. doubts)]\nمثال: それで疑いをさしはさむ余地はなくなる。\n→ That leaves no room for doubt.",
 "さしひかえる": "[to be moderate in ; to be temperate in] / اِمْتَنَعَ (To stop oneself from some action or interference; to abstain; to eschew) / لَازِمَة, قَرَار (The chorus or burden of a song repeated at the end of each verse or stanza.)  [to refrain (from doing)] / [to be beside ; to be close by]",
 "さしひき": "اِسْتِنْتَاج (A process of reasoning that moves from the general to the specific, in which a c)  [deduction] / [ebb and flow ; rise and fall]",
