 "さしむける": "أَرْسَلَ, بَعَثَ (To make something (such as an object or message) go from one place to another (o)  [to send]\nمثال: 今、誰か係りの者を差し向けます。\n→ I'll send someone up to help you now. / مُبَاشِر (Proceeding without deviation or interruption.) / وَجَّه, قَاد (To manage, control, steer.)  [to direct (attention)]",
 "さしも": "فَـ, لِذَا (As a result; for that reason; therefore; because of this; due to this.) / إِذًا, فَ (Used after a pause for thought to introduce a new topic, question or story, or a)  [so (much)]",
 "さしもの": "[cabinetwork ; joinery]\nusu. 指(し)物 / دَبُّوس (A pin or fastener for the hair.)  [hairpin]\noften 挿(し)物 / رَايَة, عَلَم (A flag or standard used by a military commander, monarch or nation.) / لَافِتَة (Any large sign, especially when made of soft material or fabric.) / مُلْصَق (A large piece of cloth with a slogan, motto, or emblem carried in a demonstratio) / إِعْلَان (A type of advertisement on a web page or on television, usually taking the form ) / مُمْتَاز (Exceptional; very good.)  [banner]",
