 "さし絵": "صُورَة, تَصْوِير (A representation of anything (as a person, a landscape, a building) upon canvas,) / صُورَة, صُورَة شَمْسِيَّة (A photograph.)  [picture]\nمثال: この本には美しい挿絵が入っている。\n→ This book is beautifully illustrated.",
