 "さじ加減": "جُرْعَة (A measured portion of medicine taken at any one time.)  [dosing] / [manner of seasoning] / مَهَارَة (A capacity to do something well; a technique, an ability, usually acquired or le)  [skill]",
 "さす": "لَمَعَ, وَمَضَ (To emit or reflect light so as to glow.)  [to shine] / [to be visible] / [to be tinged with]\nمثال: ほお紅や口紅を差すだけで表情や笑顔がどんどん変わってくるんです。\n→ Expressions and smiles change like that just from applying rouge and lipstick. / نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise (of water levels)]",
