 "さずかりもの": "بَرَكَة, نِعْمَة (Some kind of divine or supernatural aid, or reward.) / نِعْمَة (Good fortune.) / نِعْمَة (Something someone is glad of.)  [blessing]",
 "さずける": "مَنَحَ (To give (bestow upon or confer, particularly in answer to prayer or request).) / مِنْحة (An application for a grant (monetary boon to aid research or the like).)  [to grant]\nمثال: 聖霊がある方の上に下って、その上にとどまられるのが見えたなら、その方こそ聖霊によってバプテスマを授ける方である。\n→ The man on whom you see the Spirit come down and remain is he who will baptize with the Holy Spirit. / عَلَّمَ (To cause (someone) to learn or understand (something).)  [to teach]",
