 "さそう": "دَعَا, عَزَمَ (To ask for the presence or participation of someone or something.)  [to invite] / أَغْوَى, أَغْرَى (To provoke someone to do wrong, especially by promising a reward; to entice.) / أَغْرَى (To attract; to allure.)  [to tempt]\nمثال: ウラウラとした日差しに誘われて、眠りに落ちた。\n→ The soft, gentle sunlight beckoned me to sleep. / اِسْتَفَزَّ (To cause someone to become annoyed or angry.)  [to provoke]",
