 "さた": "شَأْن (Something which is done or is to be done; business of any kind, commercial, prof) / عَلَاقَة غَرَامِيَّة (An adulterous relationship, chiefly of a married person. (from affaire de cœur, )  [affair] / حُكْم (A decision on an issue of fact in a civil or criminal case or an inquest.)  [verdict] / إرشادات (Instructions for how to reach a destination or how to do something)  [directions] / لَاحَظَ (To remark upon; to mention.) / لَاحَظَ, اِنْتَبَهَ (To become aware of; to observe.)  [notice]",
 "さたのほか": "عَبَثِيّ, سَخِيف (Contrary to reason or propriety; obviously and flatly opposed to manifest truth;)  [absurd]",
