 "さだ": "بِالتَّأْكِيد (In a way which is certain; with certainty.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (Without doubt, surely.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (An emphatic affirmative answer; of course.)  [certainly]",
 "さだか": "مَعْرِفَة (Designating an identified or immediately identifiable person or thing, or group )  [definite]\nمثال: 船田氏が新党に加わるかどうかは、定かでは、ない。\n→ It is not certain if Mr Funada will join the new party.",
 "さだまり": "قَانُون, قَاعِدَة (A regulation, law, guideline.) / حُكْم, حُكُومَة (The act of ruling; administration of law; government; empire; authority; control) / حَكَمَ (To regulate, be in charge of, make decisions for, reign over.)  [rule]",
 "さだむ": "قَرَّرَ, صَمَّمَ (To resolve (a contest, problem, dispute, etc.); to choose, determine, or settle.) / قَرَّرَ (To make a judgment, especially after deliberation.)  [to decide] / وَصَفَ (To order (a drug or medical device) for use by a particular patient (under licen) / أَمَرَ (To specify by writing as a required procedure or ritual; to lay down authoritati)  [to prescribe] / [to bring peace (to) ; to make peaceful]",
 "さだめ": "قَانُون, حُقُوق (A rule, such as:) / قَانُون (A rule, such as:)  [law]\nمثال: この定めから逃れないといけない。\n→ I need to escape from this decree. / قِسْمَة, مَصِير (The presumed cause, force, principle, or divine will that predetermines events.)  [fate]",
 "さだめし": "بِالتَّأْكِيد (Certainly, undoubtedly.)  [surely]",
 "さだめて": "بِالتَّأْكِيد (Certainly, undoubtedly.)  [surely]",
 "さだめない": "مُؤَقَّت, سَريع الزوال (Passing or disappearing with time; transitory.)  [transient]",
 "さだめる": "قَرَّرَ, صَمَّمَ (To resolve (a contest, problem, dispute, etc.); to choose, determine, or settle.) / قَرَّرَ (To make a judgment, especially after deliberation.)  [to decide]\nمثال: ヘーゲルと同様に、パノフスキーの弁論方の概念は歴史があらかじめ定められた道程をたどるようにさせている。\n→ In the same way as Hegel, Panovsky's notion of the dialectic makes history follow a predetermined course. / وَصَفَ (To order (a drug or medical device) for use by a particular patient (under licen) / أَمَرَ (To specify by writing as a required procedure or ritual; to lay down authoritati)  [to prescribe]\nمثال: 職員の選考に関する規則を次のように定める。\n→ Rules in connection with staff selection are set as follows. / [to bring peace (to) ; to make peaceful]",
