 "さっか": "مُؤَلِّف, مُصَنِّف (The originator or creator of a work, especially of a literary composition; or, o) / أَلَّفَ (To create a work as its author.)  [author]\nمثال: その作家は私たちによく知られています。\n→ The writer is well known to us.",
