 "さっきょう": "مَحْصُول (The production amount of such an output for a specific season or year, particula) / حَوْصَلة (A pouch-like part of the alimentary tract of some birds (and some other animals))  [crop (conditions)]",
 "さっきょく": "مُؤَلَّف, مُصَنَّف (A work of music, literature or art.)  [composition (of music)]\nمثال: この音楽はバッハによって作曲された。\n→ This music was composed by Bach.",
