 "さっこう": "رَقَّى (To raise (someone) to a more important, responsible, or remunerative job or rank) / رَوَّجَ (To advocate or urge on behalf of (something or someone); to attempt to populariz)  [promoting]",
 "さっこん": "مُؤَخَّرًا (in the recent past) / حَدِيثًا (in the recent past) / بِأَخَرَة (in the recent past)  [recently]\nمثال: 昨今は災害が頻ぴんとあった。\n→ Recently we have had several disasters.",
