 "さっそう": "مُتَحَمِّس (Spirited, audacious and full of high spirits.) / وَسِيْم (Chic, fashionable.)  [dashing]\nمثال: 彼の歩き方はさっそうとしている。\n→ He walks in a stately manner.",
